<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  THE CARD THAT DOES NOT REACT — the subscription card on Главная, and any surface that
  HOLDS controls instead of BEING one.

  Same recipe as @drawable/bg_server_card (colorSurface, radius_card, one even hairline
  outline on all four sides) with the ripple taken out, and the ripple is the whole
  point of the file existing. bg_server_card is a <ripple>, so it flashes
  colorPrimaryContainer across its entire area the moment the view is pressed — and the
  subscription card IS pressable, because a long press on it deletes the подписка. Every
  touch that landed on the card therefore lit the card.

  The owner reported both halves of that as defects, in the same breath:

      «кнопка скрытия раскрытия слишком сильно подсвечивается слишком огромный свет
       появляется при нажатии»
      «при нажатии на раскрытие серверов, почему-то моргает тулбар с подпиской, он
       ваще должен быть статичный и никаких у него потемнений и тд не должно быть
       из-за взаимодействия»

  So: the card is INERT. It has no pressed state, no ripple, no elevation change and no
  tint change, whatever is done to the controls sitting on it. Those controls carry
  their own feedback, bounded to themselves (@drawable/bg_control_disc).

  The long press still works — it just no longer paints. Feedback for it is the haptic
  and the dialog it opens, which is what a destructive action should answer with anyway.
-->
<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:shape="rectangle">
    <solid android:color="?attr/colorSurface" />
    <corners android:radius="@dimen/radius_card" />
    <stroke
        android:width="@dimen/stroke_hairline"
        android:color="?attr/colorOutlineVariant" />
</shape>
